{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UnF_62S75wxRXcaqNUxEYA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:26.490587+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UnF_62S75wxRXcaqNUxEYA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/NpPX2ZIBHlVzcSvJD87m4Kg3vBJs8xNOsUvvRzlk4wXB0Scvicv9Xe7qMIOoQMmnZBNz2dWib6JTqR1B8xzDhOiaNTAuJtrf1Gk9JAcZLsTfj8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><span>为促进全国优秀大学生之间的交流，增进优秀大学生对浙江大学电气工程学院的全面了解，同时为基础扎实、热爱科研、德才兼备、立志攻读博士/硕士学位的优秀大学生打造优质的继续深造平台，浙江大学电气工程学院拟于</span></span><strong><span><span>7月10日</span></span></strong><span><span>举办“2026年全国优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营”活动（线上）。具体安排如下：</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>招收对象</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><span>欢迎有意攻读我院</span><span><strong><span>博士和硕士研究生</span></strong></span><span>的外校2027届优秀本科生积极报名。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>有意在今年9月推免时申请我院免试推荐博士/硕士研究生，具有较强的科研能力和从事科研工作的强烈意愿的本科生；</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>预期可获得所在高校推免资格的2027届优秀本科生；</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>今年9月推免申请直博的英语水平要求为：达到全国大学英语六级460分及以上，或托福80分及以上，或雅思5.5分及以上，或具有与此相当的其他各类外语考试成绩，成绩有效期五年（考试时间在2022年6月及以后）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>01 网上报名</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>即日起至7月5日</span></strong></span><span>，登录“2026年浙江大学夏令营系统”报名，首次登录需先注册账号。报名链接地址：</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login，具体操作方法详见附件</span></span><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>02 材料递交</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>无需邮寄纸质材料，按报名系统要求在网上提交相关材料（成绩单和排名需加盖院系的成绩校核章，其他希望呈现的材料可一并打包上传）扫描件即可。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>03 其他材料</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>入选营员的其他材料可在开营前另行提交。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>04 重要提示</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>报名截止日期为</span></span><span><strong><span><span>2026年7月5日23:00</span></span></strong></span><span><span>，逾期不再接受申请。报名时根据系统提示填写个人信息后、并填写有关个人成绩/科研业绩信息等。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>4</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>活动安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>本次夏令营相关活动将采用腾讯会议的方式举行。后续通知请关注电气工程学院官网-人才培养-研究生招生栏目。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学院夏令营活动将组织开展电气学科规划及方向、电气学院研究生培养方式、培养方案、特色及就业介绍、专题讲座等。夏令营具体流程及后续安排另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>夏令营只做招生宣传活动，今年九月份推免阶段，欢迎有意攻读电气工程学院博士和硕士学位的同学关注电气学院官网-人才培养-研究生招生栏目“2026年接收2027级外校推荐免试生事宜（专题）”网页。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>浙江大学玉泉校区电气工程学院研究生教育教学办公室，教二410，许老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span><span>0571-87951691</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>邮箱：eexunuo@zju.edu.cn</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>附件：学生操作手册</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UnF_62S75wxRXcaqNUxEYA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">浙江大学研究生招生管理系统学生操作手册.docx</a></span></p><p><span><span><br/></s